<li>Apply the validated change to your production branch (for example, create the same index in production through your migration workflow).</li>
<li>If your optimization includes application-level query changes, deploy those code changes to production.</li>
<li>Run a quick production-safe verification, such as checking endpoint latency and error rate after deployment.</li>
<li>You can now safely delete the <code>load-test-branch</code> to clean up the temporary resources.</li>
<li>From the Neon Console, navigate to <strong>Branches</strong>, find <code>load-test-branch</code>, click the three dots on the right, and select <strong>Delete</strong>.</li>
